            "review_title": "Review at Thursday's Child",
            "review_text": "Sophia N\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nGood Vibe 😎\nFeb 2020 • Friends\nThe food was creatively present on the plate and tasty also. I love the atmosphere here, it brings me a chill vibe and give us great photos. Even though, it is quite crowded on weekends so we couldn’t take a lot of picture of us there. I recommend half pizza and truffle bacon mushroom linguini pasta :)) the cream is well-tasted but it could be more saucy and it go perfectly with some rose hoegaarden beer. Luckily, i chose wisely from the beginning 🥳. I would love to go back and have a nice chill day at the pool. 🕶💦\nP.s: If anyone is interested, check this out. This will be a hell of an experience for your family and friends. 🤘🏻💕. The cool thing is this resto is pet friendly 🐶 for those who are pet lovers. The resto also serve water and food for your pets too ❤️\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 12, 2020",
